    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loneliness_intro",
        "key": "$loneliness_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_meowlong",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Medjehtiqedti!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "As if it wasn't enough that you went off by yourself first thing in the morning, now you're slamming doors and disturbing my nap! Have you repaired the harp, or have you been enjoying Athenius so much you forgot about your job?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no use trying to repair the harp...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Giving up so soon? You can't fix a tiny crack like that? What were you doing in all those classes you took in Columbia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just filling in the crack and painting over it isn't hard. But it's not just the harp that was damaged\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was also your fragile bleeding heart?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was also Sargon's reputation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kereseira's harp was one of the best-preserved relics I've ever seen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wooden instruments are highly sensitive. The slightest blemish on the body could change its sound.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was why we were very careful during the appraisal process and avoided any destructive tests...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've heard it a million times at the museum\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "'The ornaments, string materials and lacquer are typical of the Minoan style. Historical records indicate that it very likely belonged to Kereseira herself.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But something didn't feel right when I was repairing it last night...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "The wood chips that fell from the crack indicate that the material was mountain firs, the kind that ancient Minoans often used, but something was off with the cross-section texture.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The weapons of the heroes are made from ancient trees. They'll have some pretty deep texture.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it didn't look like the natural texture of wood. It was reminiscent of a certain moisture retention technique developed in Sargon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I read about it in old books about instrument-making. Minoan plants are rich in moisture, while the climate in Sargon is generally dry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wood imported from Minos had to be specially treated to prevent them from cracking due to the dryness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cross-section I saw showed signs of such treatment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean this was not Kereseira's original harp, but a replica made by Sargonians using Minoan wood? You sure you're not overthinking it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't want to believe it, but I just took the wood chips to a lab.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Testing revealed the presence of Sargonian resin, dating back about a hundred years...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oof...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The harp looked perfect. It was virtually impossible to tell that it was a replica without destructive testing. I doubt Padishah Khery knew anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to tell the Astynomos. We can't give the Minoans a fake harp under the eyes of Kereseira's statue!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#13$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 50,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "The exchange ceremony must be stopped!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ambassador Medjehtiqedti's mission was to 'carry out' the exchange ceremony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Behnui Effendi...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We made an oath to the padishah before we set out. How can you continue to call yourself the ambassador of Sargon, if you fail to retrieve the engineering data from the construction of the Three Poleis?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I have my duties as ambassador. As an archaeologist, however, I can't overlook such a mistake, much less intentionally participate in a lie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why I say you have no political acumen. You see yourself as a museum curator, not a diplomatic envoy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "The important thing about the relic exchange ceremony is not the relic, but the exchange. Who cares if the harp is a replica? It still makes a sound.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to offer up a fake harp at the ceremony?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Absolutely not!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what is your bright idea, Medjehtiqedti, without the authentic harp and a ceremony right around the corner?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the halls of Menat-Ha'mait, you told Padishah Khery that you loved the legends of Minos, and wanted to see true heroism with your own eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is your idea of heroism clinging to your obsessions and bringing shame to your country at the very first cultural exchange between Sargon and Minos since the establishment of diplomatic relations?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you and your useless father one and the same?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He ruined your family, turned the name Nasutu Mashayer into a high society joke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "In his obsession with literature, he abandoned his duties, even his duty to his daughter, forcing her to chase the shadows of heroes in books, failing to find any heroism in her father.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This has nothing to do with him! I only love Minoan stories because\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "'As emissaries of Sargon, our priority is to carry out the exchange ceremony successfully\u2014not our own obsessions and interests.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your words, verbatim.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll find a way, before the ceremony, no matter what it takes. I can't let a fake...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Obstinate fool.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well. You can meditate while I act on your behalf and carry out the duty that the Sargonian ambassador was supposed to perform.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It not as if it changes anything. To the Astynomos and the guests, you're nothing more than a curious girl, an enthusiastic volunteer for the temple project while I negotiated with the Astynomos\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am, for all due intents and purposes, the true ambassador of Sargon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
