    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello. Maybe you don't remember me, but I've visited this ranch quite a lot lately. The herder, Melitta, knows me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, stop leaning on the fence and let me through.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Opens sleepy eyes)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Burdenbeast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was not my intention to interrupt your nap. Perhaps you will enjoy this grass. The dew is still fresh on it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_pcknmbrth",
        "volume": 1,
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Burdenbeast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I also brought some berries.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_pcknmbrth",
        "volume": 1,
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": 2,
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Burdenbeast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I'm out of bribes. In that case...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you like a dream interpretation? K\u00fdrios... maybe k\u00fdria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Brushes teeth on the fence)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Burdenbeast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cauliflower is a girl. Berries are too sweet for her, and grass isn't filling enough. You need carrots to draw her attention.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#8$1",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you find a burdenbeast has a fever and not even its favorite food can coax it to move...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just scoop some water with a leaf and spray it on its horn to cool it down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really know your burdenbeasts, Melitta. I didn't know there were so many tricks to getting a burdenbeast to move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. They're not like beckbeasts, which are used to taking commands. A herder needs a hundred tricks to coax burdenbeasts into doing what you need them to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melitta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's this understanding that builds a bond between burdenbeast and herder.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Melitta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I right, Cauliflower?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Melitta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_pcknmgrwl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sways tail)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Burdenbeast"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Gets up and leaves)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Burdenbeast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2090_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-150,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
