        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-70,0",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#3$1",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "70,0",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melitta"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe it's a talent, to know one more way to get burdenbeasts to move than other herders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melitta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks for getting Cauliflower to move, Melitta.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melitta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The priestess of Endymion Temple gracing us with her presence means that this place is blessed by the heroes. We couldn't be happier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melitta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as it doesn't cause any trouble for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not! All you do is admire the sights and look at the fence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melitta"
    },
    {
        "text": "A little while back, I was concerned that a foal could slip through the cracks in the fences. A few days later, you filled the gaps with strong threads.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melitta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just doing my part.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was a very kind deed. I won't disturb you anymore; I have a few hooves to trim.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melitta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2080_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "posfrom": "70,0",
        "posto": "210,0",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "-70,0",
        "posto": "200,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kassandra leans towards the 'filled fence', where delicate threads stand in regular intervals, gleaming in the sun."
    },
    {
        "text": "She plucks one of the threads, hearing nothing except the breeze blow over the pasture."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course it wouldn't make a sound. Not even a burdenbeast running into it did...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "There isn't much time. When will you sing again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
