    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "69_g14_luxuriousroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what you're here for, K\u00fdrios Behnui.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rest assured that the relationship between our two nations is the highest priority. A little incident will not be allowed to affect it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A little incident?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Xanthos came to Athenius five years ago, working as ferryman and manager of the crossing. He took in an apprentice, Lykeion, a former priest school student.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "text": "They are accused of attempting to steal from the room of Ambassador Medjehtiqedti. They are being held in custody, pending trial in accordance with the law.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since the ambassador has elected not to press charges\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A justification to comfort the ignorant people by a naive girl moonlighting as supervisor of the rebuilding of the First Temple, not the decision of the honored ambassador of Sargon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see your views differ from Kyr\u00eda Mashayer's.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will, of course, take full responsibility for this matter as Astynomos. However, I would ask that the two of you come to an agreement as to how we deal with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know what I mean, Astynomos. My view is that of the Sargonian delegation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This tragedy, the theft and destruction of the harp, would never have happened if the exchange ceremony was not repeatedly delayed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have reason to suspect that you have intentions other than promoting the relationship between our two nations, that you have intentionally delayed the ceremony, and everything that took place did so on your orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear the position of Astynomos was newly created following the administrative reform of Athenius, and you were rewarded with the role because of your contributions to said reforms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "If something goes wrong with the first cultural exchange between our two nations since the establishment of diplomatic relations...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I congratulate you on being the only Astynomos who the people of Athenius will never forget.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The exchange ceremony is certainly my most important task. I admit I was negligent for not arriving at the scene promptly due to a busy schedule.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, how would you define this incident... this 'theft and destruction of the harp'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The brutal, barbaric, ignorant, baseless hatred of the perpetrators... the robbery and destruction of this symbol of friendship between Sargon and Minos was a most despicable act.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "In my thirty years overseeing culture in Menat-Ha'mait, Sargon has received many letters from Minos requesting the return of the cultural artifacts that were removed during the occupation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shouldn't these plunderers of Minos's national treasure be severely punished, if you Minoans truly value it so much?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "They will be tried according to Minoan law. As far as the punishment is concerned, though...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no intention of leaving the impression that Sargon is trying to bully the people of Athenius. We are emissaries of peace, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a most sensitive time, however. Just because Sargon and Minos signed a truce five years ago doesn't mean that all is peaceful and well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "The padishahs are used to solving problems with force of arms. I would not give them a reason to get angry, if I were you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Xanthos and Lykeion conspired to steal and deface a national treasure and sabotage the exchange ceremony...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their actions are tantamount to treason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "They will be put on death row immediately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Astynomos. I look forward to the exchange ceremony in a few days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
